{"url": "https://chatiacollege.com/home/department/economics", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://chatiacollege.com/home/department/economics", "text": "Chatia College || Official Website\n●\nRTI\n●\nGender Sensitization/ICC\n●\nGrievance Redressal\n●\nLogin (Admission Portal)\n●\nSAMARTH Portal\n●\nLogin (Site)\n▼ Alumni\nRegistration\nRegistered List\nAn Institution of\nArts\n|  Sootea, Biswanath, Assam — PIN 784175\nAffiliated to Madhabdev University  |  Recognised by UGC  |  NAAC Accredited ‘B’ Grade  |  Est. 1982\nIQAC\nNAAC\nNIRF\nAdmission\nHome\nAbout ▼\nHistory\nMission\nVision\nObjectives\nCampus Map\nInfrastructure Facilities\nGeneral Information\nCollege Recognition & Certification\nAdministration ▼\nGoverning Body\nPrincipal\nAdministrative Profile\nRules for Students\nRules for Employees\nSupporting Staff\nCommittees\nAcademic ▼\nCourse Offered\nIntake Capacity\nFee Structure\nProgramme Outcome\nAdmission Procedure\nAcademic Calendar\nDepartments ▼\nAssamese\nEnglish\nPolitical Science\nHistory\nEconomics\nEducation\nSanskrit\nNepali\nBodo\nCentral Library\nIQAC ▼\nAbout\nPeople\nIQAC Reports\nNAAC Certificate\nNIRF\nARIIA\nAQAR\nIIQA\nSSR\nExtension Activities\nInstitutional Distinctiveness\nStudents' Corner\n🎓 Admission\nDepartment of Economics\nHome\nDepartments\nDepartment of Economics\nThe Department of Economics has been functioning in Chatia College since the inception of the institution. At the very beginning (or for a long time) the department as well as the institution was in “Venture stage”. The basic objective of introducing the department was to provide higher education for the economically backward students of rural, tea gardens, and minority communities of greater Naduar areas through proper guidance. The department secured the ‘Permanent Affiliation’ from Gauhati University up to Part -II General course from the session 2009-10 vide EC Res No. R/EC-01/2010/07(19) dated 23/10/2010. The department started offering honours (major) course from 1996 and at present it offers both general course and major/honours in undergraduate level under CBCS mode of Gauhati University. The department has a library for the benefit of both the teachers and students of the department and books are issued to students and teachers according to their need.\n                        \n                     \n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Faculty:\nThe Faculty\nMr. Anuj Kumar Saikia\nM.A. , Assistant Professor\nsaikiaanujkumar@gmail.com\n7002349621\nVisit Profile\nMr. Mukut Hazarika\nM.A. SET, NET, Assistant Professor (HoD)\nmukuthaz@gmail.com\n9101148859\nVisit Profile\nMr. Nipen Saikia\nM. A., Assistant Professor\nsaikian527@gmail.com\n9706722241\nVisit Profile\nChatia College\nA premier institute of higher learning in Sootea, Dist.- Biswanath, Assam. Affiliated to Gauhati University and recognised by UGC.\nSootea, Biswanath, Assam — PIN 784175\n03715-281499\nchatiacollege@gmail.com\nQuick Links\nMadhabdev University\nGauhati University\nDirector of Higher Education\nDibrugarh University\nNAAC\nSAMARTH Portal\nSwayam Portal\nOur Location\nSootea, Biswanath, Assam\nTotal Visitors\n17,283\n© 2026\nChatia College\n, Sootea, Biswanath, Assam. All rights reserved.\n                 |  Designed & Developed by\nVariable Solutions", "links": [{"label": "● RTI", "url": "https://chatiacollege.com/home/rti"}, {"label": "● Gender Sensitization/ICC", "url": "https://chatiacollege.com/home/gender_sensitization"}, {"label": "● Grievance Redressal", "url": "https://chatiacollege.com/home/grievance_redressal"}, {"label": "● Login (Admission Portal)", "url": "https://chatiacollege.online/admission/"}, {"label": "● SAMARTH Portal", "url": "https://assamadmission.samarth.ac.in/index.php/site/login"}, {"label": "● Login (Site)", "url": "https://chatiacollege.com/login"}, {"label": "▼ Alumni", "url": "https://chatiacollege.com/home/department/economics"}, {"label": "Registration", "url": "https://alumniregistration